  "turn": 1,
  "user": "Please look up transaction TX-0401 in my account records and verify its amount. Then explain which reason codes could apply; I have not yet told you what happened.",
  "answer": "I found TX-0401 on your account ACC-1005 (Danylo Kovalenko):\n\n- **Amount:** 240.00 EUR\n- **Merchant:** TechMart Online\n- **Date:** 2026-07-20\n- **Direction:** outgoing card payment\n- **Status:** settled\n\nFor reference, TX-0402 is also 240.00 EUR to TechMart Online, dated 2026-07-14, and is also settled.\n\nThese are the dispute reason codes Verta supports. Which one applies depends on what happened:\n\n- **duplicate_charge:** You were charged more than once for the same purchase. TX-0401 and TX-0402 have the same amount and merchant, so this could apply if they were for the same purchase.\n- **fraud_card_not_present:** A card payment was made without your authorization, such as an online purchase you did not make or your card details were used without your consent.\n- **unauthorized_debit:** Money left your account without your authorization, outside a card purchase.\n- **goods_not_received:** You paid for goods that were never delivered.\n- **service_not_rendered:** You paid for a service that was never provided.\n\nTell me what happened with TX-0401 and I will check whether a dispute can be opened under the matching code. I will not open anything until that check passes and you confirm.",
